Spec: SpecDD Plugin Metadata

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / XML

Purpose:
  Define the IntelliJ plugin descriptor for SpecDD language support.

Owns:
  ./plugin.xml

Can modify:
  ./plugin.xml

Can read:
  /src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/SpecDDPluginMetadataBehaviorSpec.kt
  /src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/*
  /src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/highlighting/*
  /src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/validation/*
  /src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/structure/*
  /src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/documentation/*
  /src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/completion/*
  /src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/references/*
  ./logo.svg
  ./pluginIcon.svg

Must:
  Use `ai.specdd.idea` as the plugin id.
  Use `SpecDD` as the plugin name.
  Use `SpecDD` as the vendor name.
  Use `https://specdd.ai` as the vendor URL.
  Use `https://specdd.ai` as the plugin homepage URL.
  Describe the plugin as SpecDD language support for `.sdd` files.
  Describe SpecDD as an SDD framework.
  Link to `https://specdd.ai` for homepage and documentation.
  Link to `https://github.com/specdd/intellij-plugin` for source code.
  Link to `https://github.com/specdd/intellij-plugin/issues` for issue tracking.
  Include initial release change notes.
  Declare compatibility with minimum IntelliJ build `223`.
  Depend on `com.intellij.modules.platform`.
  Register the `SpecDD` file type for extension `sdd`.
  Register file type implementation `@ai.specdd.idea.SpecDDFileType`.
  Register parser definition `@ai.specdd.idea.SpecDDParserDefinition` using `lang.parserDefinition`.
  Register code style settings provider `@ai.specdd.idea.SpecDDCodeStyleSettingsProvider` using `langCodeStyleSettingsProvider` with `implementation`.
  Register syntax highlighter factory `@ai.specdd.idea.highlighting.SpecDDSyntaxHighlighterFactory` using `lang.syntaxHighlighterFactory`.
  Register color settings page `@ai.specdd.idea.highlighting.SpecDDColorSettingsPage` using `colorSettingsPage`.
  Register bundled default and Darcula color-scheme attributes using `additionalTextAttributes`.
  Register annotator `@ai.specdd.idea.validation.SpecDDAnnotator`.
  Register structure view factory `@ai.specdd.idea.structure.SpecDDStructureViewFactory` using `lang.psiStructureViewFactory`.
  Register documentation provider `@ai.specdd.idea.documentation.SpecDDDocumentationProvider` using `documentationProvider` with `implementation`.
  Register completion contributor `@ai.specdd.idea.completion.SpecDDCompletionContributor` using `completion.contributor`.
  Register path reference contributor `@ai.specdd.idea.references.SpecDDPathReferenceContributor` using `psi.referenceContributor` with `language` and `implementation`.
  Register references search executor `@ai.specdd.idea.references.SpecDDReferencesSearch` using `referencesSearch`.
  Register reference rename handler `@ai.specdd.idea.references.SpecDDReferenceRenameHandler` using `renameHandler`.
  Register path warning annotator `@ai.specdd.idea.references.SpecDDPathAnnotator`.
  Reference ./logo.svg as the file type visual identity.
  Reference ./pluginIcon.svg as the plugin icon.
  Keep extension registrations under the IntelliJ default extension namespace.

Must not:
  Register the deprecated `syntaxHighlighterFactory` extension point.
  Declare plugin descriptor dependencies beyond platform unless required by implemented SpecDD language support.
  Register plugin-specific settings or configuration UI.
  Register extension points unrelated to SpecDD language support.
